[en.DECISION_CATEGORY_C08_ENIO]
Lost Science Research Institute

[en.DECISION_CATEGORY_C08_ENIO_desc]
In the Nexus, there is a knowledge that has never been heard of in the world - §Olost science§!. It contains powerful forces, but only a small part of the information about it is recorded in the Nexus, and the rest is scattered around the world.

Fortunately, the map in the Nexus will mark the §YLost Ruins§! from time to time. After meeting §Yspecific conditions§!, we can explore these §YRuins§! and uncover the secrets hidden in them. What is in the ruins? Who knows! §RBe careful to explore, be careful...§!

Lost Science Research Progress: [?C08.VAR_C08_OCCULTISM|Y]

[zh.DECISION_CATEGORY_C08_ENIO]
失落科学研究院

[zh.DECISION_CATEGORY_C08_ENIO_desc]
科学枢纽记录着一项世上未曾听闻的知识——§O失落科学§!。其蕴含力量极其强大，枢纽中却只记有小部分关于它的资料，剩下部分散落在世界各地。

万幸，枢纽中的地图会不定期标出§Y失落遗迹§!。满足§Y特定条件§!后，我们便能探索这些§Y遗迹§!，解开其中隐藏的秘密。遗迹里有什么，谁知道呢？§R谨慎探索，小心为上...§!

失落科学研究进展：[?C08.VAR_C08_OCCULTISM|Y]
